     "texto": [
      "**甜** is sweet; **咸**, salty; **酸**, sour; **辣**, spicy; **苦**, bitter. **热** is hot and **冷**, cold.",
      "**非常** means «very» and **太** can mean «too». **有一点儿** means «a little»; in English we usually put «a little» before the adjective."
